WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.270
Congratulations are in order-ucha!

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:08.090
A toast to celebrate all three of you attaining

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.640
your Super Cyalume Coords-ucha!

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.240
Cheers!

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.160
It was touch and go there for a while, but it was all worth it in the end!

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.620
Perhaps, but I'm in no hurry to repeat the ordeal.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.210
Now we can enter the final Grand Prix-ucha!

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.590
Take that momentum all the way to the top-ucha!

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.220
Yep! After all, we're finally a real team!

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.300
We're gonna take number one in the Grand Prix!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.720
With my skill, it will be a simple task.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.400
Can finally eat you! Excited!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.980
Wh–<i>When</i> you win-ucha...

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:46.700
We've formed powerful bonds...
but your appetite is the same as ever.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.410
Such foolishness.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.150
Do not take the path to Divine Idolhood lightly.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.030
Janice...

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:58.620
You only stand at the entrance.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.180
Firstly, you must focus on
attaining victory at the next Grand Prix.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:07.540
Put forth many times more effort,
and attain the power to claim victory.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.650
You must each find it within yourselves.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.340
Firstly, Pepper.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.980
Your movements are careless. They lack precision.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:19.270
Non, you see only what you can already do well.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:23.050
Chiri! You're not reaching your potential.

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:23.680
Indeed.

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:28.940
I am the idol chosen by the Janice, sister to a goddess.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:32.790
I am well aware of the pride and responsibility this instills.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:37.780
To become a Divine Idol, I shall take your word as gospel.

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.740
Well said, Chiri. Your amenability is a virtue.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.930
Our course is clear: Divine Idolhood-ucha!

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.420
Yeah!

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:52.970
<i>The winners of the Grand Prix will
receive the baton from Onee-sama.</i>

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:59.310
<i>That moment will be my greatest opportunity to obtain it.</i>

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:44.410
One, two... one, two...

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.770
There you go, Jululu! Well done!

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:48.370
One, two... one, two...

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:51.380
She's quite the walker now.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.830
Yes, she might be better than me!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.580
A rapid advance.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.250
Children really do grow up quickly.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:01.470
We're coming up to the last Grand Prix, you know.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.930
Ain't it a problem if she's still a baby?

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:09.600
But she suddenly turns back into Jewlie; who can say?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.450
One, two... whoa!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.360
She's walking by herself...

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.370
On her own two feet?

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.740
But she only just learned how to stand.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.020
Wow, Jululu!

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.790
You're amazing!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.180
Not too shabby!

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:37.160
Way to <i>go</i>!

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:37.660
Impressive.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.300
Amazing!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.930
Oho! And Jululu's having a walking lesson-kuma!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.890
We have a little geni-usa!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.330
What a cle-bear little girl!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.680
Divine wisdom indeed...

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.840
Time to get our lesson started too-pri.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:56.800
Okay!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.770
Jululu, watch Mama closely!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:04:59.980
Kuma?

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.820
Usa?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.340
Jululu...

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.950
I mean, Jewlie!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.360
Mama!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:16.120
I'm so happy to see you again!
There's so much we can talk about!

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:19.340
Yeah, I guess so.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.520
So this is where you practice?

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:27.300
I've always wanted to be an idol and do training with you!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.260
What's going on?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.620
Why'd she suddenly grow up again?

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.850
Are you fully restored now?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.400
Not at all!

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.240
I see...

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.170
Well, it's all good.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:41.320
You're way too pri-asygoing!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:45.030
The Divine Idol Grand Prix depends on Jewlie's pri-vival!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.530
Ca–Capisce...

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:52.920
Wo–Wonderful goddess Jewlie, I–I hope the day finds you in go–good spirits-kuma–ma...

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:56.500
S–S–So, you do want to be–be–become

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.230
an i–idol-usa?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.920
There's no need to be nervous.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.630
That's right...

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:07.770
Jewlie, what did you want to say to me back then?

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:08.800
Hm?

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:12.510
<i>I... No matter what, I want to become an idol!</i>

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.850
<i>Why do you want to be an idol so badly?</i>

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.350
<i>Well...</i>

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.310
Jewlie, why do you want to be an idol?

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.540
Oh, you see...

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.550
Jewlie?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.580
I forget.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.240
Oh. Is that right?

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:35.490
Say, Mama, I really want to do idol training with you! Let's do it!

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.990
O–Okay! Capisce!

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:41.170
... two, three, four!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.090
One, two, thee, four!

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:46.340
Non, you're losing balance!

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.300
Chiri, you keep coming in too slowly!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.760
Pepper! Match the others' pace!

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:54.970
Singing, dancing and synchronisation:

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.980
polish those areas until you have them perfectly!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:58.850
Okay!

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.400
Say, this is...

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.440
Ooh-ooh?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:10.240
Janice has appeared again!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.320
But why-ucha?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:15.700
It would seem Onee-sama has returned to her goddess form.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:17.290
Jewlie has?

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.910
<i>Now this is an unexpected opportunity!</i>

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:24.650
<i>I needn't wait until the next Grand Prix; I can talk to Onee-sama directly now!</i>

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:25.540
Hey, wait!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.670
If you're going to see Jewlie, I'm coming too!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.970
Phoenix look tasty! Come too!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.590
You shall <i>not</i>!

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:33.970
You haven't time to spare.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.110
Focus on your lesson.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:39.180
It's as Janice says!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:44.400
Wa–Wait-ucha! If you head out looking like a goddess, you'll cause a commotion-ucha!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:47.100
Very true.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.320
But I haven't other garments...

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.360
Here!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.970
Found earlier!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.960
Pushu...

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:26.110
Sh–She's incredible...

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.270
Such flawless movements.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.540
So this is what a goddess is capable of...

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:31.740
Pri.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.820
Dancing together is fun!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.620
Come on, Mama, let's keep dancing!

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:42.970
S–Sure.

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:46.290
Oh... Well, if you say so, Mama.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:51.210
Say! I'd love to go to the café in PriPara Town!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.970
I think the drink I most want to try is...

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.430
Peach juice, am I right?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.090
I love you, Mama!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.700
Well, aren't you a sweetie.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.360
This is adorable!

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.860
And this is splendid, too!

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:10.340
Hey, isn't that Jewlie?

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:12.320
What? You're kidding!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:16.280
Hello! We're headed to the café; won't you join us?

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.870
What, really?

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.490
Let's go, then!

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:20.520
Yeah, so then...

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.080
Hello.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.410
Wha– Jewlie?

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.920
Say, Sasami-chan, would you like to come to the café with us?

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:30.970
Wait... why do you know my name?

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:37.430
We're, uh, picking up a ton of guests here...

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:41.640
For unworthy garb for a goddess... simply disgraceful!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.600
But I must endure this to see Onee-sama...

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:50.540
I am not a goat! No, cease this–

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.380
No! Let go of me, I say!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:55.230
Can you not hear me? Just who do you think I–

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.430
Stop! Leave me be!

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:04.950
Stop! Someone please help!

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:12.090
I can't stop thinking about it!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:16.170
I just hope Janice and Jewlie aren't fighting again...

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:18.050
That's it, a hundred percent-ucha!

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.180
Because Jewlie's too capricious!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:23.350
We should focus on practice as Janice instructed.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.940
I'm going to check on them.

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:26.850
Me too-ucha!

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.010
Me too!

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:29.770
W–Wait!

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.150
Do not leave!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.480
Will you ignore Janice's instructions?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:38.590
Training is of the utmost importance at this time.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.200
Oh, wait up!

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.600
So, great goddess, you like peach cream soda, then?

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.300
Call me "Jewlie"!

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:48.660
J–J–J–Jewlie-sama...

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:52.420
I had thought the Demon King appeared before us.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:55.360
It's funny seeing Jewlie having tea with everyone!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.840
Jululu became big!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.380
Can Garuru become big too?

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.590
Of course you can. I'm sure of it!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.900
Jewlie's so pretty!

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.720
I feel blessed seeing her up close!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:11.060
Say, say, Mirumiru-chan. What are you drinking?

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.980
Want to try each other's?

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.360
U–Um... you know my name?

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:19.360
But of course!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.570
You're in a team with Tama-chan, aren't you?

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.330
What? Oh, yes...

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:28.130
I know all your eye and hair colours, too!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.780
Anna-chan, I want to see you perform again later.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:33.540
Macaron-chan, did you finish your Making Drama?

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.980
What? You know I've been slacking off, don't you?

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:41.970
They're all pri-nchanted by her...

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.410
I'm so proud of my little girl.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:48.640
And just like that, she has a bunch more fans.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:50.960
It does a father proud.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.090
What?

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:57.600
In a sea of idols, all eyes are drawn to Jewlie.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:00.460
She's a born idol.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:05.120
No, I wonder if this is what a Divine Idol is like.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:07.870
I want to be an idol like her.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:11.190
<i>Janice...</i>

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:15.280
<i>Onee-sama.</i>

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:16.750
<i>Let us talk, the two of us together.</i>

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:23.270
Jewlie?

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:24.640
Mama.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:25.820
What? Mama?

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:26.510
She said "Mama"...

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:27.600
What's that about?

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:30.270
Would you hold this for me?

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.940
Hold something this important? But why?

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:41.280
Jewlie?

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.610
She disap-pri-eared.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.340
Where did Jewlie go?

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:44.600
Jewlie disappeared?

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:45.570
Is it magic?

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.090
Together again at last,

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.800
Onee-sama.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.160
Janice...

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.260
I wanted to see you too.

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.340
For goodness's sake...

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.880
Where <i>have</i> they got to?

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.430
There is but one matter to discuss.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:15.140
Please give me the goddess's Cyalume Baton.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.100
For the following Divine Idol Grands Prix,

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.930
I shall oversee proceedings.

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:23.240
Janice...

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:26.030
No, I cannot do that.

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.490
And why not?

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.330
You say you want to be an idol.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:40.170
Then, if you leave your duties as a goddess to me, you are free to pursue idolhood or whichever endeavour you wish.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.020
I cannot give the baton to you as you are now.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.060
And why is <i>that</i>?

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.180
You're incomprehensible, Onee-sama!

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.190
The reason...

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:53.680
Janice, I hope for you to realise it yourself.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.480
More incomprehensibility.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.940
You could cause a system breakdown at this rate.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:02.360
You could become unable to even create a Divine Idol this time!

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.900
It's not about <i>creating</i> a Divine Idol;

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:09.370
girls take a hold of their radiance of their own accord.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.530
Untrue.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.790
If we goddesses do not lead the way,

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.040
those girls are not capable of anything.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:21.770
We've observed idols since far in the past.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:27.420
An idol is a foolish and flawed existence.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.390
Unguided, they will fall into ruin.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.100
They agonise over trivial matters.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.260
They become prideful and lazy.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.490
They choose the path of atrophy of their own accord.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.840
Which is why we goddesses must show them the path,

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.860
and govern them properly!

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:50.070
"Foolish"... I as well?

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:53.280
Now, where is the baton?

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:55.740
I can't give it to you now.

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.620
So be it.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:05.340
But I will attain it nonetheless.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:08.340
By whatever means necessary.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.100
Janice...

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:21.780
<i>Janice should consider me exceptional...</i>

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:24.250
Jewlie!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:24.520
Where are you?

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:27.300
Jewlie!

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:29.630
Where could she have gone?

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.950
Janice!

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:33.780
Non?

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.950
Onee-chan! Where did Jewlie go?

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.770
She's not with Janice?

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:39.540
Huh?

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:40.870
Janice?

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.750
I've returned!

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:44.270
Jewlie!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.420
Oh! Non-oneechan!

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.060
Jewlie...

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:53.340
Are you okay? You didn't have a fight with Janice?

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.010
Eh?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.600
Were you arguing again-pri?

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.050
Not at all.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:58.810
We just had a talk.

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:00.770
That's a relief.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.690
Here you go, Jewlie.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:04.830
Thank you.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:06.980
Say, Mama.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:07.690
Hm?

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:08.650
And everyone else...

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.810
will you come and watch me perform again?

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:12.490
Of course!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:13.810
Garu!
Pri!

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.260
I must bear witness to a goddess's prowess!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:20.420
The delicate gold ornamentation seems crafted by divine hands!

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:24.330
And the jewellery adorning the edges is brilliant emerald!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.330
Emerald Eden Coord!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.380
Jewlie-sama!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.920
Jewlie-sama, you look heavenly!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.460
You're transcendental, Jewlie-sama!

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:35.970
Mm, I love you, Jewlie-sama!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.660
Jewlie!

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.510
It's Jewlie, everyone!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.010
I'm so glad to see you again!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:05.350
Come on, everyone, here we go!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:12.190
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.170
Sha-la-la!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.100
Sha-la-la-la-lan!

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:29.340
A concerto...

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:35.800
from beyond the stars!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.540
Divine Cyalume Change!

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:34.690
Jewlie!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:35.730
That felt great!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.400
You cast a spell on me!

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:41.660
Thank you, everyone! I love you all!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:46.870
I want to see you all participate in the final Grand Prix!

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:51.830
Every idol has her own unique brilliance!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:52.540
You do!

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:53.790
And you!

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:55.000
You do!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:56.710
And you do, too!

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:01.680
I can see your brilliance with my heart's gaze!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.430
You can <i>all</i> become Divine Idols!

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:06.890
Jewlie!

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:09.980
What a superficial thing to say!

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:13.350
Just what does she think a Divine Idol is<i>?</i>

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:16.460
A goddess performing,

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:18.320
on stage...

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.600
That's my opportunity.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:23.280
When the victors perform after the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.120
Did she disappear?

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.460
She just disappeared, right?

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.670
Well, she's a goddess!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.240
Happens all the time.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.590
That's right, goddesses will up and disappear on you!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:39.880
One moment there, the next: poof!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:40.750
Is it magic?

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.610
Mama!

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:45.940
Thank goodness.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.260
Wait.

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:51.980
Do I want her to stay a baby?

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:55.440
Or do I want her to return to being a goddess?

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:09.280
<i>An idol is a foolish and flawed existence.</i>

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:11.580
Chiri.

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:13.950
Yes...

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:17.170
Listen well to what I say.

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:22.300
You will attain victory at the next
Divine Idol Grand Prix without fail.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:26.550
When you do, Onee-sama will appear in her goddess form

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.770
and give the baton to you.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.020
That is when...

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:35.500
before returning it to Onee-sama,

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.190
give it to me.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.150
Wha–What?

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:42.650
The baton will fall into my hands.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:45.860
This is the only way to take the baton from Onee-sama.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.910
B–B–But...

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:51.780
I couldn't possibly steal a goddess's baton...

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:55.370
It is all for the sake of protecting the order of PriPara.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.860
Y–Yes... but...

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:04.050
It is a role I can entrust only to you,
gifted as you are with superiority and acumen.

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:06.050
You must accomplish this task without fail.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:09.890
And the matter is between you and me alone.

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:12.010
You must not breathe a word of it to anyone.

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:14.340
You understand.

00:22:14.820 --> 00:22:16.520
Y...

00:22:17.660 --> 00:22:18.820
Yes...

00:23:52.590 --> 00:23:54.240
The time has come...

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:55.740
at last-chanko!

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:58.580
We've had enough of playing second fiddle – fifteen-love!

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:00.960
Spread your wings beneath the spotlight-chanko!

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:03.460
Hearts pounding, souls Monet-ing, dance th-Ruvens the night!

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:05.960
Soon we'll have clay court our own Super Cyalume Coords!

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:08.500
A cornered rat will bite back-chanko!

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:11.840
Our legend begins Re-now!

00:24:11.840 --> 00:24:15.040
Next time: <i>Let's Live! You're Gonna Play the Lead Role,</i>

00:24:15.040 --> 00:24:15.470
Ponkan-da Vinci!
Love!

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:16.760
Chanko!

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:19.930
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
